GLiClass Edge Android host sample

Model: knowledgator/gliclass-edge-v3.0, revision df03993a2ed98e5e4a0d2dd7efbbd105abe874cf,
licensed under Apache License 2.0. Its encoder is jhu-clsp/ettin-encoder-32m (a ModernBERT
encoder), licensed under the MIT License.

The input builder and the decoder are Kotlin ports of the classification path of the gliclass
package 0.1.20 by Knowledgator (GitHub Knowledgator/GLiClass), licensed under Apache License 2.0:
ZeroShotClassificationPipeline.prepare_input (labels, separator, prompt, text) and
_postprocess_logits (softmax / sigmoid decisions). Changes include Kotlin float32 arithmetic, the
float16 embedding-table upcast, fixed graph windows, and rejection of inputs that do not fit
instead of truncation.

The tokenizer follows the published tokenizer.json contract of Hugging Face tokenizers and
transformers (Apache License 2.0): added-token extraction, NFC, the ByteLevel pre-tokenizer and
byte-level BPE.

The debug gate asset app/src/debug/assets/gate_fixtures.json holds the 144 items of SemIf
benchmarks/data/authored144.jsonl (github.com/TheoLeeCJ/SemIf-OpenJev, formerly TheoLeeCJ/SemIf,
commit ca3ba65f), Copyright (c) 2026 TheoLeeCJ, licensed under the MIT License
(licenses/SemIf-MIT.txt), together with the two examples of the model card and six invented
requests.

Gradle wrapper files retain their upstream Apache License 2.0 headers.
Retained model, encoder, library and fixture licenses are under licenses/.
